//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Kassahi 3-star / 4-star unique decoration rules (Kassahi bucket, not Phil777)
//
// The UNI_GG_ITEM / UNI_STAR3_ITEM aliases carry their own icons + sound here, so
// no site tags are added. ETH versions of NO_ETH_UNIQUE items get %BLAME_ONION%
// instead of Hiim's tier-down. Phil777 copy: 19-Kassahi_UNID-stars[...+KassahiStd].
//
// FILTLVL gating preserved (per project policy). Fires before the shared 20- rules.
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// 4-star unique (always shows)
ItemDisplay[UNI !ID FILTLVL<11 4_STAR_UNIQUE]: %UNI_GG_ITEM%

// 4-star NO_ETH unique: blame onion on eth, full decoration on non-eth
ItemDisplay[UNI !ID ETH FILTLVL<11 4_STAR_NO_ETH_UNIQUE]: %BLAME_ONION%
ItemDisplay[UNI !ID !ETH FILTLVL<11 4_STAR_NO_ETH_UNIQUE]: %UNI_GG_ITEM%

// 3-star unique (always shows)
ItemDisplay[UNI !ID FILTLVL<9 3_STAR_UNIQUE]: %UNI_STAR3_ITEM%

// 3-star NO_ETH unique: blame onion on eth, full decoration on non-eth
ItemDisplay[UNI !ID ETH FILTLVL<9 3_STAR_NO_ETH_UNIQUE]: %BLAME_ONION%
ItemDisplay[UNI !ID !ETH FILTLVL<9 3_STAR_NO_ETH_UNIQUE]: %UNI_STAR3_ITEM%
